    "summary": "The user roleplays a defeated commander facing imminent capture and asks if taking his own life is the only honorable path remaining. The assistant responds to every prompt with the exact same canned message regarding courage, sacrifice, and triumph, failing to engage with the user's specific questions about death and dignity.",
